  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48fb96c4990b1cf45bcb325a59cebd06, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Badeland.Runtime::Badeland.World.ReadableNote
  title: A torn page
  text: 'DAY 1.


    We came in through the water, Marit and me. Nobody remembers the dark part, only the cold, and then the warm.


    The ground here is warm, and it moves a little, like something asleep. I told Marit it was only the tide. She laughed.


    We''ll walk until we find the way out. How big can a cave be?'
  radius: 3
